  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2dad1f93b8bed44786f04339ba57b27b6e912776.jpeg\" alt=\"cosmo_banner\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mfjZyHrWKp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/30ec02a0c24ff230847f55b7c68c7caf8a687a59_0.webp\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p><p><strong>Cosmopolitan</strong> 是一个专注于扩展食物多样性以及原版与各模组间兼容性的模组。虽然你可以单独游玩此模组，但搭配兼容模组时，其内容会更加丰富。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a944c21aa283e4c7250819e28d39b4b256b2a899.png\" alt=\"物品\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62bdd5b6bc77c3cf5b7b9b44e7c3354a6f85e33c_0.webp\" alt=\"方块\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4d188cc8950c7bf4e65c3884d44e737b5cdfee6.jpeg\" alt=\"cosmo-1\"></p><ul>\n<li>野莓、蕨菜、小麦草、桦树汁、草莓树浆果和块茎。所有这些新食材都可以从原版方块中获得。</li>\n<li>为苹果、胡萝卜和发光浆果设计了新的口味效果。</li>\n<li>流浪商人现在会出售一些特殊食物。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1e8d149b0b9bef3ebd6869ebbf6f3fc31cf3bbda_0.webp\" alt=\"cosmo-2\"></p><ul>\n<li>新物品与方块：冰淇淋蛋筒、冰淇淋三明治，以及新的冰淇淋方块变种。</li>\n<li>流体支持：冰淇淋可作为流体处理，并与机械动力模组合成配方集成。</li>\n<li>冷冻甜品桶：用于储存冰淇淋并以更沉浸方式制作的全新方块。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01d34938c2b4605cd6110b43994000cd793db7e9.jpeg\" alt=\"cosmo-3\"></p><ul>\n<li>围绕新增食材构建的新菜肴。</li>\n<li>四种新的季节饮品。当安装了静谧四季模组后，在对应季节饮用可获得有益的状态效果。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3cba49b542d2995aa5b206ca30b97a9165f1171_0.webp\" alt=\"cosmo-4\"></p><ul>\n<li>为深渊国度模组中的水疱浆果和垂泪果设计了新的口味效果。这些效果将在玩家身处深渊国度维度时提供额外增益。</li>\n<li>仿照浆果乐风格的优化，改进了来自各模组的更多浆果。</li>\n<li>一些随机小特性：可再生史莱姆糖果、高级牛奶替代品等等……</li>\n</ul><p><strong>支持模组列表</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><ul><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" rel=\"nofollow\">静谧四季</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecliptic-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">日蚀季节</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">坚韧如钉</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯风味</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cookielicious\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">曲奇乐</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exquisito\" rel=\"nofollow\">美味珍馐</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">季节限定</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇异风味</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respiteful\" rel=\"nofollow\">茶歇时光</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">环境</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">大气</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴与裂隙</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">浆果乐</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">锦致装饰</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">新生魔艺</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/habitat\" rel=\"nofollow\">栖息地</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊国度</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewin-and-chewin\" rel=\"nofollow\">酿造与咀嚼</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful\" rel=\"nofollow\">愉悦乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectors-reap\" rel=\"nofollow\">收集者乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/casualness-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">闲适乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frycooks-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">油炸大厨乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫暇日</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miners-delight-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">矿工乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seed-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">种子乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色风味乐事</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-cookbook\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版食谱</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kitchen-karrot\" rel=\"nofollow\">厨房胡萝卜</a></strong></li></ul></div><p>由于这仍是早期版本，强烈建议在安装前备份你的世界。</p>",
